{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>Five portions.</b> Benjamin shared with his brothers, and the portion of Joseph, and the portion of Osnat, and Menasheh and Ephrayim — behold, five." "<b>And they drank and became intoxicated with him.</b> On that day, for from the day they sold him they had not drunk wine until that day, and he too had not drunk; and so the word עמו, 'with him,' requires, and this is what is written (Genesis 49): ״נזיר אחיו״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:20:04.063380829Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}